'''Ghosts''' {{Tile|X|7:1}} are a type of [[night creature]] and the spiritual essence of an intelligent [[creature]]. Some even continue to perform their jobs.{{bug|6354}} However, not all ghosts bear their anguish calmly.

Ghosts are generally immune to harm. Note that creatures with {{token|NOFEAR}} are immune to this attack.

== Paranormal Activity ==
The ghost's activities may be determined by the nature of its death and its [[personality trait]]s using the following table, ''in order'':

